{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788328071997259001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"evolved-polyester-bee","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"beca3b02419d54cb2559e1a4e95fe91382c3b57663961a53ecc1412578019069","event_uuid":"5f3e20ae-32f7-4e1a-b049-ae86c6b80d7a","position":{"commit_sha":"200db63516df858deddc58c01cb0aa0a433e0161","position":"1788314679548565001-5f3e20ae-32f7-4e1a-b049-ae86c6b80d7a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"6558a575d381cc4577f0470d7d4cfaa23dbec7f81da8aa86f4a687e621359645","event_uuid":"91f12054-ea30-4d28-a5ba-4f36fa451b5c","position":{"commit_sha":"db50ddeb9deb6e190f91833d77dcc61b59414275","position":"1788314701858981001-91f12054-ea30-4d28-a5ba-4f36fa451b5c"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"20276388ed24b9a4454350494b22b13507db7037d99a9ae2308afb0b773f7f92","event_uuid":"a31ba902-75bf-40c8-ae5c-c7e805c286b6","position":{"commit_sha":"6d4c21cac04cc19842a12e142e84f2e264dffd21","position":"1788314777913288001-a31ba902-75bf-40c8-ae5c-c7e805c286b6"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788314679548565001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"a31ba902-75bf-40c8-ae5c-c7e805c286b6","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"8eff-87c1-d09a-4893"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n\nPrivate reconciler forwarding bindings retain a second owner after moves: `apply_inbound_records._inbound_update_write_edit_event` forwards to `apply_inbound_events`; `reconcile` forwards listed pass helpers to `reconcile_helpers`/runtime; and `Mode.rank()` remains only because comparison dunders call it. The governing ADR is delivered by earthen-wheat-chick.\n\n## Approach\n\nAfter the ADR merges, migrate every source/test/string/dynamic/monkeypatch consumer to `apply_inbound_events`, `reconcile_helpers`, or runtime. Rewrite Mode comparisons to use the natural comparison dunders without `rank()`, then remove the old private bindings. Recensus on the implementation base before deletion.\n\n## Scope\n\n- inbound event-write compatibility re-export\n- reconciler pass-helper/runtime re-exports\n- `Mode.rank()` and comparison callers\n- all static and dynamic consumers\n\n## Testing\n\nRun semantic reference lookup plus raw string/`getattr`/monkeypatch scans; run inbound, orchestration, and mode-order tests.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Every old core/reconciler private name has no production, test, string, dynamic-load, or monkeypatch consumer.\n- [ ] The canonical owner is the only binding for each migrated operation.\n- [ ] Mode ordering comparisons retain all current ordering semantics without `rank()`.\n- [ ] Focused inbound/orchestration/mode tests and full scans pass.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/apply_inbound_records.py","reason":"remove forwarding event-write shim"},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/apply_inbound_events.py","reason":"canonical inbound event-write owner"},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/reconcile.py","reason":"remove pass-helper re-exports"},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/reconcile_helpers.py","reason":"canonical pass-helper owners"},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/mode.py","reason":"replace rank shim with direct Mode comparisons"},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler","reason":"migrate static and monkeypatch consumers and prove behavior"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","8eff-87c1-d09a-4893"],["parent","6640-ac11-5c55-46b5"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"6640-ac11-5c55-46b5","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["janitor","reconciler","internal-shims"],"ticket_id":"a691-3cb9-7d1d-4ef1","ticket_type":"story","title":"Migrate and remove core and reconciler internal shims","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["5f3e20ae-32f7-4e1a-b049-ae86c6b80d7a","91f12054-ea30-4d28-a5ba-4f36fa451b5c","a31ba902-75bf-40c8-ae5c-c7e805c286b6"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788328071997259001,"uuid":"f7cb3943-417c-4d3b-b90a-8ae1bed50f13"}